    "Chunk10 packages 015-020 applied and passed CI: 85 unassigned across 30 complete source formulations (5 existing, 60 missing, 20 external). Correction 001 removed a mathematically overrestricted link from general graded ring to nonnegatively graded ring, adding one missing candidate without changing unassigned count. Later audit must review all 117 accelerated externals and 196 raw candidate identities Chunks7-10. See Chunk10 progress report.",
    "CHUNK9: six applied source-free 5-formulation packets semantic-pass2-accelerated-partitions-congruence-trace-affine-009, semantic-pass2-accelerated-affine-probability-groups-010, semantic-pass2-accelerated-rationals-orders-suprema-011, semantic-pass2-accelerated-orthogonal-systems-splitting-012, semantic-pass2-accelerated-cut-cauchy-power-divring-013, semantic-pass2-accelerated-power-product-martingale-014. 95 occurrences/30 formulations, 5 existing links, 67 missing occurrences yielding 66 raw new candidate records, 23 external source-local. All six complete immutable applied receipts + graph/test CI SUCCESS. Cumulative Chunks7–9 expedited audit: 97 source-local dispositions, 135 raw candidate identities. Some candidates have equal context/phrases, but no mathematical alias claims or external source research. Review scope distinctions (orthogonality measure support, total order vs supremum, cut/cauchy, real variable G-measurability, martingale continuous-index).",
    "Chunk8: five verified applied packages semantic-pass2-accelerated-foundations-and-relations-004, semantic-pass2-accelerated-topology-analysis-005, semantic-pass2-accelerated-measure-category-continuity-006, semantic-pass2-accelerated-field-graph-metric-007, semantic-pass2-accelerated-categorical-structures-008. 80 formerly unassigned across 25 full formulations (2 existing, 46 missing, 32 external). All receipts and 10 CI runs SUCCESS. Post-pass mathematical audit must inspect 74 accelerated external dispositions and 69 raw missing candidate identities across Chunk7+8; many may require alias or splitting. No auto synonymy.",
    "CHUNK7 accelerated trial: 3 separate five-formulation immutable amend packages semantic-pass2-accelerated-foundational-axiom-triage-001 (25 classified, graph CI 39862667083), semantic-pass2-accelerated-axiom-structure-triage-002 (21 classified, CI 39863023583), semantic-pass2-accelerated-source-local-clauses-003 (20 classified, CI 39863374480). All three receipts and isolated CI verified. Totals 66 formerly unassigned: 1 linked existing meaning, 23 missing prerequisites, 42 justified source-local defining axioms/notation. Higher provisional error tolerance applies only to semantic classification, never unchecked mechanical graph integrity or skipped source reading. Mandatory final audit: all 42 external dispositions and all 23 missing candidates against 611 existing meanings and global registry. Preserve the no-external-source gate.",
    "CHUNK6 applied immutable packages, all with success receipts and independent graph/test CI: semantic-pass2-bijections-source-context-001 (5 amendments); semantic-pass2-bijection-reviewed-surface-aliases-001 (4 aliases); semantic-pass2-formal-polynomial-initial-topology-001 (4 amendments); semantic-pass2-ideal-extension-prime-contraction-lifting-001 (5 amendments); semantic-pass2-ring-contractions-and-lying-over-context-aliases-001 (4 aliases); semantic-pass2-ideal-generators-residue-and-module-spans-001 (5 amendments); semantic-pass2-monic-derivative-residue-idealaction-span-aliases-001 (5 aliases); semantic-pass2-ring-kernel-and-squarezero-constraints-001 (4 amendments); semantic-pass2-kernel-and-squarezero-contextual-aliases-001 (4 aliases). Latest graph CI 39861024600 success; isolated tests 39861024462 success. Applied inbox files immutable; do not overwrite.",
    "IMPORTANT distinctions and reviewed reuse: bijective set map is not a structural isomorphism; formal polynomial derivative differs from analytic derivative and from its image being a unit of a ring; splitting a polynomial over K differs from constructing a minimal splitting field; Galois σ↦σ(a) differs from polynomial evaluation; initial topology is a coarsest making maps continuous; ideal extension IS differs from preimage contraction φ^-1(J) and prime-ideal lying-over relation; going-up and going-down are distinct quantified lift properties; finite ideal generation in a commutative unital ring reuses existing finitely-generated R-module; I^n differs from I^n M and quotient M/I^n M; square-zero J^2=0 differs from generic nilpotence and ring kernel in general.",
    "Efficiency policy from user: implement only genuinely noticeable improvements, don't optimize for its own sake. Document minor potential improvements in research_pipeline/MINOR_POSSIBLE_IMPROVEMENTS.md, created this chunk; review near end of Pass2. Do not automate contextual mathematics or lexical candidate alias acceptance. Currently proven ~3–5 full formulation packages and version-anchored digest guards work; a local digest mismatch stopped attempted packet before any commit, then corrected.",
    "Workflow: fetch versioned original full source + independent 611 meaning inventory; reconstruct effective node SHA256 using original immutable node and all append-only amendments; check complete and version; choose exact existing targets, context-specific missing or justified original-source external condition; create bounded mode:amend full replacement adjacency; verify receipt + graph and isolated tests; then separate manually reviewed aliases from applied missing_candidates, never invent candidate IDs. Read-only helper dependency_context_worklist --contains-any and mechanical dependency_review_preflight exist for local workspace; not semantic adjudicators.",
